# MSCA vault — absorbed from the standalone embedded repo into the parent
# orchestrator repo (D8 / ticket 2, 2026-07-16). Pre-absorb history is archived
# in ../MSCA-preabsorb-b4d9e57.bundle and recorded in
# docs/tier4_orchestration_state/reinstantiation_provenance.json.
#
# The graph nodes (methodology_graph/**) and vault config (.obsidian/plugins,
# .obsidian/community-plugins.json, CLAUDE.md, CONTEXT.md, sources/, docs/) are
# tracked. Only runtime/tooling caches and per-user UI state are ignored below —
# they are regenerated on demand and are not graph content.

# Smart Connections embeddings cache (regenerated on demand)
.smart-env/

# Serena language-server cache
.serena/

# Scratch / working notes
.scratch/

# Obsidian per-user UI state (window layout, graph view position). The plugin
# set (.obsidian/plugins/) and community-plugins.json ARE tracked so the vault
# is self-contained and Dataview can be enabled in ticket 5.
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.obsidian/graph.json
